test "rank1810: an engine override that skips the consult runs its SQL unscreened"
  lang python
  reject VYQL-INJ-001
  file superset/db_engine_specs/hive.py
  code
  ```
  class HiveEngineSpec(BaseEngineSpec):
      engine = "hive"

      @staticmethod
      def execute(cursor, query, database, async_=False):
          kwargs = {"async": async_}
          cursor.execute(query, **kwargs)
  ```
